  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Pair: ⟦{沸|わ}く→沸く：01122_waku⟧ (intransitive, to boil). Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{沸|わ}かす (boil X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing action. {沸|わ}かしている = 'is boiling/heating.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦お{湯|ゆ}→お湯：02518_oyu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{沸|わ}かす (boil water)\n- ⟦お{風呂|ふろ}→お風呂：00802_ofuro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{沸|わ}かす (draw a bath)\n- ⟦やかん→やかん：02476_yakan⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{沸|わ}かす (boil in a kettle)\n- {沸|わ}かして⟦おく→置く：01092_oku⟧ (boil in advance)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {沸|わ}かす (transitive): boil X\n- ⟦{沸|わ}く→沸く：01122_waku⟧ (intransitive): X boils\n\nUSAGE NOTE: ⟦お{風呂|ふろ}→お風呂：00802_ofuro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{沸|わ}かす refers to heating bathwater, traditionally done manually. Modern usage may still use this even with automatic bath systems.",
